Package: tidysd
Title: A Tidy Grammar for System Dynamics Modelling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Rayhan Ali", "Rachman", email = "rayhanalirachman@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Specify stock-and-flow system dynamics models as three independent
    layers -- structure (what exists and how it is wired), equations (functional
    forms) and parameters (numbers and data) -- and simulate them with one verb.
    Supports subscripted (arrayed) models, graphical lookup functions, exogenous
    data drivers, Vensim-style delay and smoothing built-ins, scenario runs,
    least-squares calibration and tidy long-format output with 'ggplot2' methods.
